#. ねぇ、苗木君。
#. 約束だったよね？
msgctxt "0001 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Hey, Makoto! You remember your promise?"
msgstr ""

#. え、約束…？
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? What promise?"
msgstr ""

#. …忘れちゃったの？
msgctxt "0003 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Did you forget already?"
msgstr ""

#. 約束…したよ…
#. 今度は苗木君の事を話してくれるって…
msgctxt "0004 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "You promised that we could talk about you this time!"
msgstr ""

#. そっか…忘れちゃったんだね…
msgctxt "0005 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "You really did forget..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>不二咲さんはガックリと肩を落としたまま、
#. とぼとぼと歩き去ってしまった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Chihiro looked really disappointed. With sagging\n"
"shoulders, she wandered away.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …そうだ、約束してたんだ。
#. <CLT 3>今度はボクの事を話す<CLT>って…
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"That's right, I did promise. She wanted to <CLT 3>talk about\n"
"me<CLT> this time..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>追った方が…いいよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'd better go after her...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは不二咲さんの後を追って、
#. 慌てて彼女の部屋へと向かった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I headed to Chihiro's room.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0010 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. えーっと…聞いて欲しいんだけど、
#. 約束を忘れた訳じゃないんだ。
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Listen, I just wanted to tell you that I didn't forget\n"
"about my promise...!"
msgstr ""

#. ちゃんと覚えてるからさ…
#. 元気出してよ…
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Of course I remember! So cheer up, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. …じゃあ、聞かせてくれるの？
#. 苗木君の事…
msgctxt "0013 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "...Then can we talk about you today?"
msgstr ""

#. うん…それは構わないけど…
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Sure, I don't mind at all!"
msgstr ""

#. ホントに！　良かった！
#. じゃあ、座ってよ。
msgctxt "0015 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Really? Great! Then come in and sit down."
msgstr ""

#. え？　部屋に入っていいの？
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? I can...come in?"
msgstr ""

#. うん、もちろんだよ！
msgctxt "0017 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Yeah, of course!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>成り行きとは言え、簡単に男子を部屋にあげて…
#. 無防備過ぎやしないかな…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I know what she said, but I'm not sure she should be\n"
"so quick to let down her defenses like this...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、さっそく聞かせてよ。
#. 苗木君の事。
msgctxt "0019 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Okay, let's go! I wanna hear all about you!"
msgstr ""

#. 聞かせるも何も…
#. 何を話したらいいのかな？
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I'm happy to talk, but what do you want to know?"
msgstr ""

#. 質問ならあるよ。
msgctxt "0021 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Well, let's start with a question."
msgstr ""

#. …え、何？
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君って、普段は何をして過ごしてるの？
msgctxt "0023 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "What do you like to do in your spare time?"
msgstr ""

#. そうだな、普段は…
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Well, you know..."
msgstr ""

#. …テレビ観たり、ゲームしたり、
#. 後はゴロゴロしたり…くらいだけど。
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I watch TV, play video games, lay around... That's\n"
"pretty much it."
msgstr ""

#. え？　スポーツは？
msgctxt "0026 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Huh? What about sports?"
msgstr ""

#. …スポーツなんて全然だよ。
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Oh, I don't really play anything."
msgstr ""

#. 体育の授業と、
#. 遅刻しそうな時に走るくらいしか…
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The only time I run anywhere is during gym, or when\n"
"I'm running late in the morning..."
msgstr ""

#. え？　それなのに…
#. そんなに、たくましいの？
msgctxt "0029 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Really? And you're still so strong?"
msgstr ""

#. たくましい？　ボクが？
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Strong? Me?"
msgstr ""

#. いや、むしろボクなんて、
#. 男子としては最低レベルだって！
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"N-No, I'm pretty much on the bottom rung of\n"
"masculinity!"
msgstr ""

#. 男子として最低レベル…
#. 苗木君で…？
msgctxt "0032 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "You're on...the bottom rung?"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ…
msgctxt "0033 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0034 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>なんか…しょんぼりしてるみたいだけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Chihiro seemed...disappointed, somehow.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ねぇ、どうかしたの？
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hey, what's the matter?"
msgstr ""

#. あのね…<CLT 3>強い人<CLT>を捜してるんだ…
msgctxt "0037 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Well, it's just... I'm looking for <CLT 3>someone strong<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 強い人…？
#. それなら大神さんが…
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Someone strong? Well, what about Sakura...?"
msgstr ""

#. …ううん。
#. <CLT 3>男子<CLT>で捜してるんだよね…
msgctxt "0039 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "...No, I mean a <CLT 3>guy<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 大和田クン
msgctxt "0040 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Mondo"
msgstr ""

#. 十神クン
msgctxt "0041 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Byakuya"
msgstr ""

#. 十神クンかな。
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Maybe Byakuya...?"
msgstr ""

#. 十神…君？
#. そうかな…？
msgctxt "0043 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Byakuya? You think so...?"
msgstr ""

#. 困ったところもあるけど
#. 何があっても動じないし…
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Yeah, no matter what kind of problems he runs into,\n"
"I've never seen him get rattled or anything."
msgstr ""

#. いつでも、自分は自分だって態度が取れるところは
#. 強いって言えるんじゃないかな？
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"If you can believe in who you are no matter what\n"
"happens, that must take a certain kind of strength..."
msgstr ""

#. そう…だね…
msgctxt "0046 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Yeah, that's true..."
msgstr ""

#. でも…十神クンじゃ…
msgctxt "0047 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "But I don't think Byakuya's the one..."
msgstr ""

#. え？　どうかした？
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

#. ううん…なんでもないけど…
#. 十神クン以外では…誰だと思う？
msgctxt "0049 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"O-Oh, it's nothing. Does anyone besides Byakuya come\n"
"to mind?"
msgstr ""

#. 大神さん
msgctxt "0050 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Sakura"
msgstr ""

#. うーん…
#. 大神さんより強い人が思いつかないよ…
msgctxt "0051 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Hmmm... I honestly just can't think of anyone stronger\n"
"than Sakura."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0052 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>すごくしょんぼりしてる…
#. なぜか…罪悪感が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0053 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She seems really depressed for some reason. I kinda\n"
"feel guilty now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. どうしても男の人じゃないとダメなんだ？
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Does it really absolutely have to be a guy?"
msgstr ""

#. うん…
msgctxt "0055 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr ""

#. そっか…
#. じゃあ、ええっと…
msgctxt "0056 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Okay. In that case...umm..."
msgstr ""

#. 思いつかない…かな…？
msgctxt "0057 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "You really can't think of anyone?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんな、すがるような目で見られたら…
#. 答えないとダメだって気分になるよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0058 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>When she looks at me with those big, pleading eyes...\n"
"I feel like I'd die if I let her down...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 男子で強い人…
#. やっぱり、ケンカ慣れしてる彼だろうな…
msgctxt "0059 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Thinking about strong guys, there *is* someone here\n"
"who's probably been in a lot of fights..."
msgstr ""

#. それなら、<CLT 3>大和田クン<CLT>かな…
msgctxt "0060 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Then what about <CLT 3>Mondo<CLT>?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>“超高校級の暴走族”<CLT>の彼が、
#. 男子では一番強いと思うけど…
msgctxt "0061 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"He's the <CLT 3>Ultimate Biker Gang Leader<CLT>, right? He's\n"
"gotta be the strongest guy here."
msgstr ""

#. 大和田クン…
#. やっぱり、そうだよね！
msgctxt "0062 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Mondo... Yeah, that's it!"
msgstr ""

#. でも、強い人を捜してるなんて、
#. どうして？
msgctxt "0063 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But why are you looking for a strong guy?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0064 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>あれ…？　また黙り込んじゃった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0065 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Huh? She went all quiet again...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もしかして、強い男の人が好きとか、
#. そういう理由だったり？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0066 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Are you, like...into tough guys or something?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 鍛えたいんだ…
#. 体が…弱いからさ…
msgctxt "0067 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "I want to...start training. I'm so weak..."
msgstr ""

#. …え？
msgctxt "0068 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. 強い人から意見を聞けば…
#. 何か参考になるかなって思ったんだ…
msgctxt "0069 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"I thought if I could talk to someone strong about it,\n"
"it might help motivate me."
msgstr ""

#. そっか、そういう事だったんだ…
msgctxt "0070 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So that's why, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. だったら、ごめん。
#. ボクじゃ、役に立てないよね…
msgctxt "0071 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Sorry, I wish I could help somehow..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0072 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. あのさ、苗木君には、
#. 何か…<CLT 3>コンプレックス<CLT>とかある？
msgctxt "0073 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"Hey, Makoto...? Do you have any kind of,\n"
"um...<CLT 3>inferiority complex<CLT>?"
msgstr ""

#. …コンプレックス？
msgctxt "0074 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Inferiority complex...?"
msgstr ""

#. 自分で自分の嫌いなところとか…
#. 許せないところとか…
msgctxt "0075 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"You know, some part of you that you can't stand.\n"
"Something you absolutely hate..."
msgstr ""

#. そんなの、もちろんあるよ。
msgctxt "0076 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Well, I guess so..."
msgstr ""

#. ボクの場合は、
#. 普通で平凡過ぎる事かな…
msgctxt "0077 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "For me, it's how forgettably ordinary I am."
msgstr ""

#. ここに来てからは、
#. 特に痛感させられっぱなしだよ。
msgctxt "0078 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I've been made painfully aware of this part of me ever\n"
"since I came here."
msgstr ""

#. みんなは“超高校級”なんて才能を持っているのに、
#. ボクだけが大した才能もなくて…
msgctxt "0079 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The rest of you all have your ultimate abilities, but\n"
"I don't have any kind of talent at all."
msgstr ""

#. そういう気持ちって…どうやって克服するの？
msgctxt "0080 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "And...how do you overcome that kind of feeling?"
msgstr ""

#. …克服なんて出来ないよ。
msgctxt "0081 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I'm not sure I can..."
msgstr ""

#. だから、受け入れるようにしている。
#. コンプレックスがあるのは仕方ないんだって。
msgctxt "0082 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"That's why I decided to just accept it. It's how I\n"
"feel, and there's nothing I can do about it."
msgstr ""

#. それに、クヨクヨ考えてるヒマがあるなら、
#. 何か具体的に行動した方がいいかなって…
msgctxt "0083 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"And if I find myself thinking about it too much, I\n"
"just find something else to do with my time."
msgstr ""

#. 夢中になって何かをやってれば、
#. コンプレックスなんて忘れられる気がするんだよね。
msgctxt "0084 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"If I throw myself into something hard enough, I can\n"
"forget about it for a little while."
msgstr ""

#. 夢中になって…何かをやる…
msgctxt "0085 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Throw myself into something..."
msgstr ""

#. …そっか、そうだよね。
msgctxt "0086 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "I see. That's a good idea."
msgstr ""

#. 行動に移さない限りは、
#. 何も変わらないんだもんね…
msgctxt "0087 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"If I don't do something, nothing's ever going to\n"
"change."
msgstr ""

#. うん、何かわかった気がするよ！
#. <CLT 3>苗木君のアドバイス<CLT>のお陰で！
msgctxt "0088 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Yeah, I think <CLT 3>your advice<CLT> has helped me understand!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>アドバイスなんて…
#. そんな大それたものでもないと思うけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0089 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Advice? I'm not sure it was anything like that...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …えへへ！　ありがとね、苗木君！
msgctxt "0090 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Ehehe... Thanks, Makoto!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それでも不二咲さんの役に立てたなら、
#. まぁ、いいか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0091 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Well, if it helped, that's good enough for me.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それに、不二咲さんと色々と話せたお陰で、
#. 彼女の事もよくわかったし…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0092 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Talking to her like this, I feel like I've gotten to\n"
"know Chihiro really well.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんだか、心が通じ合えた気がするって言うか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0093 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I think we understand each other a lot better...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>本当の意味で、
#. 不二咲さんと<CLT><CLT 3>“仲間”<CLT><CLT 4>になれたのかもしれない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0094 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I wonder if maybe I've finally become a <CLT><CLT 3>friend<CLT><CLT 4> to\n"
"her in the truest sense of the word.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>不二咲千尋の<CLT><CLT 3>通信簿<CLT><CLT 23>に、今の情報を追記致しました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0095 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Chihiro's <CLT><CLT 3>Report Card<CLT><CLT 23> has been updated based on your\n"
"experience with her.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>おめでとうございます。
#. スキル<CLT><CLT 3>“チートコード”<CLT><CLT 23>を獲得致しました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0096 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>You just unlocked the skill <CLT><CLT 3>Cheat Code<CLT><CLT 23>!\n"
"Give yourself a pat on the back. You've earned it!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しばらく不二咲さんと雑談した後、
#. ボクは自分の部屋へ帰る事にした。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0097 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>After talking with Chihiro a little while longer, I\n"
"decided to head back to my room.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
